    },
    "质量越高，文件越大；节省空间会牺牲更多细节。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Higher quality means larger files; saving more space sacrifices more detail."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "质量越高，文件越大；节省空间会牺牲更多细节。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "品質越高，檔案越大；節省空間會犧牲更多細節。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "降低分辨率会显著减少体积，但细节会少一些。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lower resolution can greatly reduce size, but details will be reduced."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "降低分辨率会显著减少体积，但细节会少一些。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "降低解析度會顯著減少體積，但細節會少一些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "预计大小会因原视频编码、运动复杂度和 HDR 状态产生偏差，最终以压缩完成报告为准。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimated size can vary by original encoding, motion complexity, and HDR status. The final report is the source of truth."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "预计大小会因原视频编码、运动复杂度和 HDR 状态产生偏差，最终以压缩完成报告为准。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
