    "左右滑动切换照片，不会打乱整理进度。需要清理时，再用明确的动作加入待确认列表。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe left and right to move between photos without changing review progress. When you want to clean up, add items to the confirmation list intentionally."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
