    "默认上滑只是先放进待删除，最后统一确认。手势和视频播放方式都可以在整理页快速调整。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By default, swiping up only adds a photo to To Delete. You confirm everything at the end, and can adjust gestures and playback from the review screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "默认上滑只是先放进待删除，最后统一确认。手势和视频播放方式都可以在整理页快速调整。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
